# ---- Test-only scripts ---------------------------------------------------
# `scripts/` as a whole IS shipped — seed.py, backfill_*.py, audit_*.py and
# repair_*.py are run inside the container via
# `docker compose run --rm backend python scripts/<x>.py`. These nine are not:
# they are the shadow E2E suite (PROJECT_KT.md:119) and fire live API calls at
# whatever host they find, so they have no business in a production image.
scripts/test_*.py
